d sweets.\n\n【Impression representative】: moon, cat, candle, flame\n\n【About clothing】\n1.Freedom of clothing. \n2.You can choose a dress you like in the reference picture.\n\nPlease draw her in the dark with a burning candle🙇‍♂️\n\nThank you for browsing.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-XS_MuVtXHbd_qLCCqQqX28yr5u9_emv", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mm_3n_/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0429acc/uploads/origins/53b87218-ff4d-4385-ae04-a74c832996a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4a56229b31905dc3ac0f2f41d466efc4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f0429acc/uploads/origins/53b87218-ff4d-4385-ae04-a74c832996a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4a56229b31905dc3ac0f2f41d466efc4, https://si.imgix.net/f0429acc/uploads/origins/53b87218-ff4d-4385-ae04-a74c832996a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4f723b1a448225fab3e023c09c4a7e72 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f0429acc/uploads/origins/53b87218-ff4d-4385-ae04-a74c832996a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=024f41a29fc9180a200bc1faa9526764 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mm_3n_/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ba11896/uploads/origins/a732508a-459e-43db-a2fe-7a2a24ee23e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aae54ccc04873ece7fc81f3deea4779c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ba11896/uploads/origins/a732508a-459e-43d